# @umbraco-cms v19 prereleases aren't on the public npm registry — they ship to MyGet's
# umbracoprereleases feed alongside the NuGet prereleases. Once v19 stable lands on npm,
# remove this line and re-pin peer deps to the public registry.
@umbraco-cms:registry=https://www.myget.org/F/umbracoprereleases/npm/
